,{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.6, pp. 36–37; scans 44–45"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选五元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\)</span> 是两个不同方向标签。结构谓词之后的子句固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,p\\in Q\">\\(q,p\\in Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\">\\(i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\)</span>。有限步闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>；词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TwoDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,q_0,F\\;\\left[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TwoDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\delta,q_0,F\\;\\left[M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}\\coloneqq Q\\times\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}\\coloneqq Q\\times\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n(q,i)\\to_{M,w}(p,j)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\left[i=k\\land\\bigl((\\delta(q,w(k))=(p,\\mathsf R)\\land j=k+1)\\lor(0&lt;k\\land\\delta(q,w(k))=(p,\\mathsf L)\\land j=k-1)\\bigr)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\n(q,i)\\to_{M,w}(p,j)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|-1\\}\\;\\left[i=k\\land\\bigl((\\delta(q,w(k))=(p,\\mathsf R)\\land j=k+1)\\lor(0&lt;k\\land\\delta(q,w(k))=(p,\\mathsf L)\\land j=k-1)\\bigr)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nR_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,C\\prime)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}^2:C\\to_{M,w}C\\prime\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nR_{M,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,C\\prime)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}^2:C\\to_{M,w}C\\prime\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists p\\in F\\;((q_0,0),(p,|w|))\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}}(R_{M,w})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists p\\in F\\;((q_0,0),(p,|w|))\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_{M,w}}(R_{M,w})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>接受在越过输入右端时发生。首格要求左移时无后继；右端之外也没有后继。空输入的初始位置已在右端，因此按原书的反身闭包语义，恰在初态为终态时接受。无限来回移动不会被判为接受。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$M$ 为候选五元组；$\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R$ 是两个不同方向标签。结构谓词之后的子句固定有效 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$，$q,p\\in Q$，$i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|w|\\}$。有限步闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]；词见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。"